independent or joint IP without the Author's written permission.

2. Using official builds (Free and Pro)

"Official builds" are the VsTerm installers and program files the Author
publishes through official channels (website, official download site,
official GitHub Releases, etc.).

  1) Free use: any individual or organisation may download, install and use
     official builds free of charge, for any purpose, including commercial use
     and internal production environments, on any number of devices.

  2) Pro: a Pro license obtained through official channels (subscription,
     purchase or trial) may also be used commercially. Pro is licensed per
